namespace UObjectToolTips

DreamPanelSlot {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamPanelSlot.h#DreamPanelSlot
    src   "UMG-style per-child layout data owned by the child widget."
    text  "由子控件拥有的 UMG 风格的每个子项布局数据。"
    state machine
}

DreamPanelSlot:AuthoredAnchorData {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamPanelSlot.h#DreamPanelSlot:AuthoredAnchorData
    src   "Authored rect preserved independently from the serialized rect currently produced by a panel pass."
    text  "自定义矩形，与面板传递当前生成的序列化矩形独立保存。实际的自定义尺寸另行存储，因为拉伸锚点取决于父级尺寸。仅适用于 WrapBox，与 UMG 的 UWrapBoxSlot 相同：当此子项是其行的最后一个子项时，它会占用该行剩余的空间。其他任何子项在该行中都会忽略此设置。只有该行的最后一个子项才会读取此标志。"
    state machine
}

DreamPanelSlot:AuthoredDesiredSizeFallback {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamPanelSlot.h#DreamPanelSlot:AuthoredDesiredSizeFallback
    src   "Actual authored size is stored separately because stretched anchors depend on the parent size."
    text  "实际创作的尺寸单独存储，因为拉伸锚点依赖父级尺寸。"
    state machine
}

DreamPanelSlot:bFillEmptySpace {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamPanelSlot.h#DreamPanelSlot:bFillEmptySpace
    src   "WrapBox only, matching UMG's UWrapBoxSlot: when this child is the LAST one on its line, it takes\nwhatever room the line has left over. Asked by any other child on the line, it does nothing --\nSWrapBox reads the flag for the line's last child alone. Read by no other panel."
    text  "仅限 WrapBox 插槽，与 UMG 的 UWrapBoxSlot 一致：当此子项是其所在行中的最后一个时，它会占据\n该行剩余的全部空间。该行上的其他子项询问此标志时不会有任何效果——\nSWrapBox 只读取行内最后一个子项的标志。其他面板都不会读取。"
    state machine
}

DreamPanelSlot:bForceNewLine {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamPanelSlot.h#DreamPanelSlot:bForceNewLine
    src   "WrapBox only, matching UMG's UWrapBoxSlot::bForceNewLine: begin a line at this child however much\nroom is left on the current one. The unconditional twin of FillSpanWhenLessThan, which only breaks\nonce the box is narrow; this is how a section heading stays at the head of its own row."
    text  "仅限 WrapBox 插槽，与 UMG 的 UWrapBoxSlot::bForceNewLine 一致：无论当前行还剩多少\n空间，都从此子项开始新的一行。它是 FillSpanWhenLessThan 的无条件版本，后者只在\n框变窄时才换行；这样分区标题就能始终留在其所在行的行首。"
    state machine
}

DreamPanelSlot:bLayoutGeometryApplied {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamPanelSlot.h#DreamPanelSlot:bLayoutGeometryApplied
    src   "Persists so an asset reloaded after Apply still knows that AnchorData contains arranged geometry."
    text  "持久保存，使应用后重新加载的资产仍能知道 AnchorData 中存有已排布的锚点几何体。"
    state machine
}

DreamPanelSlot:FillSpanWhenLessThan {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamPanelSlot.h#DreamPanelSlot:FillSpanWhenLessThan
    src   "WrapBox only, matching UMG's UWrapBoxSlot: when the box's wrap width drops below this, give this\nchild a line to itself. Zero disables it. The classic use is a responsive list of cards that stops\nsharing rows once the panel is narrow enough that sharing would make everything unreadable."
    text  "仅限 WrapBox 插槽，与 UMG 的 UWrapBoxSlot 一致：当框的换行宽度低于此值时，让此\n子项独占一行。零表示禁用。经典用法是响应式的卡片列表，当面板窄到共享行会让\n内容全部无法阅读时，就不再共享行。"
    state machine
}

DreamPanelSlot:GetAlignment {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamPanelSlot.h#DreamPanelSlot:GetAlignment
    src   "UMG's Alignment: where inside its own rect the widget's position refers to. This plugin's Pivot."
    text  "UMG 的对齐：控件的位置在其自身矩形内所参照的位置。本插件中即枢轴点。"
    state machine
}

DreamPanelSlot:GetLayer {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamPanelSlot.h#DreamPanelSlot:GetLayer
    src   "UMG's UGridSlot::Layer, which is this slot's ZOrder under its UMG name rather than a second number.\n\nA grid's layer and a slot's z-order state the same fact -- which children of the panel draw over\nwhich -- and UDreamLayoutContainerGridPanel already reorders its children by ZOrder, stably. Two\nstored numbers for one fact would only raise the question of which one wins."
    text  "UMG 的 UGridSlot::Layer，它就是这个插槽的 ZOrder 在 UMG 中的名称，而不是另一个数值。\n\n网格的层和插槽的 Z 顺序表达的是同一件事——面板的哪些子项绘制在\n哪些之上——而 UDreamLayoutContainerGridPanel 已经按 ZOrder 稳定地重排其子项。同一个事实存两个\n数值，只会引出哪一个说了算的问题。"
    state machine
}

DreamPanelSlot:GetLayout {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamPanelSlot.h#DreamPanelSlot:GetLayout
    src   "UMG's UCanvasPanelSlot rect family, reading and writing the widget's own FDreamUIAnchorData.\n\nA canvas child here states its rect through its anchors, exactly as one does in UMG through\nFAnchorData -- so these are a second NAME for that data, never a second copy of it. Everything\nbelow goes straight to the widget's setters, which raise the right invalidation and keep the\nauthored-geometry snapshot in step; a slot that stored its own position would be the one thing\nguaranteed to disagree with the transform shown in the details panel.\n\nThe axis convention is this plugin's throughout: y points UP, anchors are measured from the\nbottom, and Alignment IS the pivot. UMG measures y downwards, so a literal port would have to\nnegate it -- and then SetPosition and SetAnchoredPosition would describe the same widget in two\nopposite languages. The names and the shapes are UMG's; the axes are the ones the details panel,\nthe .dui files and every other setter here already use.\n\nOffsets are the four edge insets from the anchor rect (UDreamWidget::GetAnchorOffset), which is\nUMG's meaning on a STRETCHED axis. On a point anchor UMG reuses Offsets.Right/Bottom to mean the\nsize instead; that reading lives on GetSize/SetSize here, and Offsets stays insets on both."
    text  "UMG 的 UCanvasPanelSlot 矩形族，读写控件自身的 FDreamUIAnchorData。\n\n这里的画布子项通过其锚点声明矩形，与 UMG 中通过\nFAnchorData 声明完全一样——因此这些是那份数据的另一个名称，绝不是它的另一份副本。下面的内容\n都直接交给控件的 setter，由它们触发正确的失效并让\n创作几何体的快照保持同步；一个自己存储位置的插槽，恰恰是唯一必然与\n细节面板中显示的变换不一致的东西。\n\n坐标轴约定在本插件中始终如一：y 轴向上，锚点从\n底部度量，而对齐就是枢轴点。UMG 的 y 轴向下，所以照搬过来必须\n取反——那样 SetPosition 和 SetAnchoredPosition 就会用两种相反的语言描述同一个控件。\n名称和形式是 UMG 的；坐标轴则是细节面板、\n.dui 文件和这里其他所有 setter 早已使用的。\n\n偏移量是从锚点矩形量起的四个边缘内缩（UDreamWidget::GetAnchorOffset），这正是\nUMG 在拉伸轴上的含义。在点锚点上 UMG 复用 Offsets.Right/Bottom 表示\n尺寸；这种解读在这里位于 GetSize/SetSize 上，而 Offsets 在两种情况下都仍是内缩量。"
    state machine
}

