DreamPanelSlot:MinDesiredSize {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamPanelSlot.h#DreamPanelSlot:MinDesiredSize
    src   "Floor and ceiling applied to whatever this child measures, per axis, zero meaning \"no opinion\".\n\nSizeBox has carried MinDesiredSize/MaxDesiredSize since the beginning, but SizeBox takes one\nchild, so constraining one item of a StackBox or one cell of a GridPanel meant wrapping it in a\nwhole extra panel. These say the same thing on the slot, where UMG's own per-slot minimums live.\nApplied at the single point every panel measures through (UDreamPanelLayoutBase::GetDesiredSize),\nso no panel needs to know about them and none can forget: min wins over max when they cross,\nmatching SizeBox, and neither one forces a size the way SizeBox's overrides do -- they bound the\nmeasurement, and the panel's own alignment and fill rules then do what they always did."
    text  "按轴应用于此子项所测得的任何尺寸的下限和上限，零表示“不发表意见”。\n\nSizeBox 从一开始就带有 MinDesiredSize/MaxDesiredSize，但 SizeBox 只接受一个\n子项，所以要约束 StackBox 中的某一项或 GridPanel 中的某个单元格，就得把它包进\n一整个额外面板。这些属性在插槽上表达了同样的意思，也正是 UMG 自己按插槽设置的最小值所在之处。\n它们应用在每个面板都会经过的同一个测量点（UDreamPanelLayoutBase::GetDesiredSize）上，\n因此没有面板需要了解它们，也没有面板会遗漏：两者交叉时最小值优先于最大值，\n与 SizeBox 一致，而且两者都不会像 SizeBox 的覆盖值那样强制尺寸——它们只是限定\n测量结果，之后面板自身的对齐和填充规则照旧生效。"
    state machine
}

DreamPanelSlot:NotifySlotChanged {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamPanelSlot.h#DreamPanelSlot:NotifySlotChanged
    src   "Reason defaults to Measure, the safe answer. Alignment, size rule, fill weight and z-order pass\nArrange instead: none of them appear in any panel's MeasureLayout - checked one by one - so they\ncannot move a preferred size, only where this slot's widget ends up inside its own parent.\nPadding, the grid coordinates and bAutoSize all do appear there, and keep the default."
    text  "Reason 默认取 Measure，这是稳妥的选择。对齐、尺寸规则、填充权重和 Z 序应改传\nArrange：它们都不出现在任何面板的 MeasureLayout 中——已逐一核对——因此无法移动\n首选尺寸，只决定此插槽的控件最终落在其父级内的哪个位置。\n填充、网格坐标和 bAutoSize 都会出现在那里，应保留默认值。"
    state machine
}

DreamPanelSlot:Nudge {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamPanelSlot.h#DreamPanelSlot:Nudge
    src   "A fixed offset added to wherever the panel decided to put this child, in the panel's content space\n(x right, y down -- the same sense as Padding).\n\nUMG carries this on UGridSlot alone. Here it is applied at the single point every panel places a\nchild through (UDreamPanelLayoutBase::ApplyChildRect), so a stack, a wrap box and an overlay all\nhonour it without knowing it exists. It is deliberately invisible to MEASUREMENT: nudging a child\nmust not resize the panel around it, which is precisely why UMG calls it a nudge and not a position."
    text  "在面板决定放置此子项的位置上叠加的固定偏移，位于面板的内容空间\n（x 向右，y 向下——与填充方向一致）。\n\nUMG 仅在 UGridSlot 插槽上提供此项。这里它在每个面板放置子项都会经过的唯一位置\n（UDreamPanelLayoutBase::ApplyChildRect）生效，因此 StackBox、WrapBox 和 Overlay 都\n无需知道它的存在便会遵循。它对测量刻意不可见：微调子项\n不得改变其周围面板的尺寸，这正是 UMG 称之为微调而非位置的原因。"
    state machine
}

DreamPanelSlot:ZOrder {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamPanelSlot.h#DreamPanelSlot:ZOrder
    src   "Paint order among siblings, applied as a stable reorder (equal values keep sibling order).\nConsumed by Overlay and GridPanel always, and by CanvasPanel when SortChildrenByZOrder is on;\nevery other panel arranges strictly by sibling order and ignores this value."
    text  "同级之间的绘制顺序，以稳定重排的方式应用（相同值保持同级顺序）。\nOverlay 和 GridPanel 始终使用，CanvasPanel 在 SortChildrenByZOrder 开启时使用；\n其他所有面板严格按同级顺序排列，忽略此值。"
    state machine
}

